        <body>
            <div xml:id="d773">

                <pb facs="1238" n="1142" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg1142"/>

                <head>No. 770.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Boker to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-12-26"><hi rendition="#italic">December</hi> 26, 1873</date>.
                        (Received January 23, 1874.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 176.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to transmit herewith a
                    copy of a dispatch from Hugo Hillebrandt, esq., United States consul at Canea,
                    Crete, announcing the successful laying of a telegraphic cable between
                    Alexandria, Egypt, and Sitia, Crete.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c,</p>
                <closer><signed>GEO. H. BOKER.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d773-a1.xml" xpointer="d773-a1"/>
            </div>
